Type: Package
Package: campsisfit
Title: Estimation of Campsis Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Nicolas", "Luyckx", email = "nicolas.luyckx@lynxsoft.be", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Lynxsoft", role = "cph")
  )
Maintainer: Nicolas Luyckx <nicolas.luyckx@lynxsoft.be>
Description: Estimate the parameters of pharmacokinetic (PK) /
    pharmacodynamic (PD) models written with 'campsismod'. Models are
    exported to 'nlmixr2' and fitted with the estimation methods it
    provides (FOCE, FOCEi, SAEM, etc.). Estimation settings are S7 objects
    that can be read from and written to JSON.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/lynxsoft-labs/campsisfit
BugReports: https://github.com/lynxsoft-labs/campsisfit/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    campsismod (>= 1.6.0),
    jsonlite,
    jsonvalidate,
    methods,
    nlmixr2est,
    S7
Suggests:
    nlmixr2data,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Remotes:
    campsisverse/campsismod@model_extension
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
